<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JON" style="id">- Dawuro Full Bible Latin Version</book>
  <para style="h">Yoonaasa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Yoonaasa Timbbitiyaa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yoonaasa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yon.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yoonaasa Timbbitiyaa</para>
  <para style="imt">Geluwaa</para>
  <para style="ip">Yoonaasa mas'aafay S'oossaa azazuwaa polikke giide itti nabiyaa bolla gakkeedda dumma dumma metuwaa odiyaa taarikiiyaa mas'aafaa gidiyaa gishaw, hara mas'aafatuwaappe I dummatee. S'oossay Yoonaasa, «Israa'eeliyaw waana morkke gideeddanne wolk'k'aama, Asoore kawutetsaw waanna katamaa gideedda Nanawe ba» yaagiide azazeedda; shin Yoonaasi, «S'oossay kase he katamaa d'ayissana giide odeedda mino oduwaa kiitan peeshshennan agganaw haneedda» giide k'oppeedda diraw, S'oossaa k'aalaa akkiide Nanawe baanaw koyibeenna. Daro taarikebatuu poletteeddawaappe guyye nashettennan de'iidde azazetteedda. Kase odetteedda bashshaa hananawe polettibeenna gishaw hank'k'etteedda.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ha mas'aafay ubbabaa bollan S'oossaw maatay de'iyaawaa odeedda. Ubbaa k'ay Goday siik'uunne maarotetsay kumeedda S'oossaa gidiyaa gishaw, bare asaa morkkatuwaa muriyaawaappenne d'ayisiyaawaappe, unttunttoo atto giyaawan unttuntta ashiyaawaa dosiyaawaa k'onc'c'isseedda.</para>
  <para style="iot">Shemppatuwaa Ubbatoo Imetteedda K'antsa K'ofatuwaa</para>
  <para style="io1">Yoonaase Godaappe Bak'atussaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="JON 1:1-17">1:1-17</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yoonaasa Woosaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="JON 2:1-10">2:1-10</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yoonaase Nanawe Buussaanne Asaa Nagaraa Paas'etsaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="JON 3:1-10">3:1-10</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">S'oossay Immeedda Maarotaan Yoonaasa Hank'k'uwaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="JON 4:1-11">4:1-11</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JON 1" />
  <para style="s">Yoonaasi Godaappe Bak'atussaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="JON 1:1-17">1:1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">1. <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 1:1" />Med'inaa Godaa k'aalay Amiitaaya na'aa Yoonaasakko hawaadan yaagiidde yeedda;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 14:25">2 Kat. 14:25</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JON 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 1:2" />«Dendda! He wolk'k'aama katamaa Nanawe ba; baade he katamaa asaa iitatetsay ta sintsa gakkeedda gishaw, unttunttoo markkatta» yaageedda. <verse eid="JON 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 1:3" />Shin Yoonaasi Med'inaa Godaa sintsaappe bak'atiide, Tarsseese giyaa gadiyaa baanaw denddeedda; I Yoop'p'e katamaa wod'd'iide, Tarsseese biyaa markkabiyaa demmeedda. Med'inaa Godaa sintsaappe bak'atiide, unttunttuna Tarsseese baanaw miishshaa c'iggiide, markkabiyaan geleedda.<verse eid="JON 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 1:4" />Shin markkabii biishshin, Med'inaa Goday abbaa bolla wolk'k'aama c'arkkuwaa dentseedda; dentsina abbaa beetay loytsi dareedda gishaw, markkabii me"ana haneedda. <verse eid="JON 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 1:5" />Yaatina, markkabiyaa laaggiyaawanttu yayyiide, ubbaykka barenttu s'oossaakko s'oossaakko waasseeddino. K'ay markkabii kawushana mala, Aa giddon de'iyaa c'aanaa dentsiide, abban oleeddino. Shin Yoonaasi markkabiyaw giddo kifiliyaa geliide, yan gisiide, gem"ishuwa pannureedda.<verse eid="JON 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 1:6" />Markkabiyaa kaappuu gem"ishaad biide, «Ayaw gem"ishaaddii? Dendda, ne s'oossaa woossa! Ooni erii, I bare lo"o ayfiyaan s'eelliide, nuuna ashshanaawenttone» yaageedda.<verse eid="JON 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 1:7" />Markkabiyaa laaggiyaawanttu ittuu ittoo hawaadan yaageeddino; «Haayite; ha iitabay nuuna O gaasuwaan gakeddenttone eranaw saamaa yeggoytte» yaageeddino. Saamaa yeggina, saamay Yoonaasa bollan wod'd'eedda. <verse eid="JON 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 1:8" />Unttunttu Yoonaasa hawaadan yaagiide oochcheeddino; «Ha iitabay O gaasuwaan nu bolla gakeddenttone, ane nuw oda. Ne kiitay ayee? Hak'appe yaad? Ne gadii hak'ee? Neeni O zare?» yaageeddino.<verse eid="JON 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 1:9" />Yoonaasi zaariide, hawaadan yaageedda; «Taani Ibraawe asaa; abbaanne gadiyaa med'd'eedda Med'inaa Godaw, saluwaa S'oossaw goynnay» yaageedda.<verse eid="JON 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 1:10" />Med'inaa Godaa sintsappe I bak'atiyaawaa I unttunttoo odeeddabaappe asatuu ereedda gishaw yayyeeddino. Aa, «Laa ayba palabaa ootsaaddii?» yaageeddino.<verse eid="JON 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JON 1:11" />K'ay abbaa beetay kasewaappe haa dareedda gishaw, asatuu Yoonaasa, «Nuw abbay woppana mala, neena nuuni waatane?» yaagiide oochcheeddino.<verse eid="JON 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JON 1:12" />I unttunttoo, «Ha wolk'k'aama beetay hinttenttu bollan denddiide ta gaasuwaana gidiyaawaa taani eray. Hewaa gishaw, taana dentsiide, abban olite. Yaatooppe, abbay hinttenttoo woppu gaanawaa» yaageedda.<verse eid="JON 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JON 1:13" />Shin markkabiyaa laaggiyaawanttu markkabiyaa guyye abbaa doonaw kessanaw wolk'k'appe baas'eteeddino; giddoppenne, abbaa beetay loytsi dareedda gishaw, kessanaw danddayibeykkino. <verse eid="JON 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JON 1:14" />Hewaa gishaw, unttunttu hawaadan yaagiide, Med'inaa Godaakko waasseeddino; «Abeet Med'inaa Godaw, ha bitaniyaa shemppuwaa gishaw, neeni nuuna d'ayssennaadaaninne ha geeshsha suutsaa ac'uwaa neeni nuuppe achchenaadan, nuuni neena minisiidde woosseetto. Ayaw gooppe, Med'inaa Godaw, neeni ne koyyowaadan ootsaadda» yaageeddino.<verse eid="JON 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JON 1:15" />Hewaappe guyye, Yoonaasa dentsiide, abban oleeddino; olina abbaa beetay woppu geedda. <verse eid="JON 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JON 1:16" />Yaatina, asatuu Med'inaa Godaw loytsi yayyeeddino; Med'inaa Godaw yarshshuwaa yarshsheeddino; shiik'uwaakka shiik'k'eeddino.<verse eid="JON 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JON 1:17" />Yoonaasa mittana mala, itti wolk'k'aama moliyaa Med'inaa Goday giigisseedda; he moliyaa uluwaan Yoonaasi heezzu gallassaanne heezzu k'ammaa de'eedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:40">Mat. 12:40</ref></char></note><verse eid="JON 1:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JON 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JON 2" />
  <para style="s">Yoonaasa Woosaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="JON 2:1-10">2:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 2:1" />Yoonaasi moliyaa uluwaan de'iidde, hawaadan yaagiide, Med'inaa Godaakko, bare S'oossaakko, woosseedda; <verse eid="JON 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 2:2" />«Taani ta tuggaa giddon de'aadde Med'inaa Godaa s'eesaad; s'eesina I taw koyeedda. Taani Si'ooliyaa ulo giddon de'aadde waassaad; neenikka ta waasuwaa sisaadda. <verse eid="JON 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 2:3" />Neeni taana c'iimma abbaa garissan duge olaadda; haatsay ta yuushshuwaa dooddeedda; ne umbuletiyaa ne beetay ta bollaanna aad'd'eedino. <verse eid="JON 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 2:4" />Hewaa gishaw, taani hawaadan yaagaaddi; ‹Taani ne sintsappe wora olettaad; giddoppenne, taani ne Geeshsha Golliyaa zaaraade be'ana› yaagaaddi.<verse eid="JON 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 2:5" />«Haatsay taw k'ood'iyaa gakkanaw mitteedda; c'iimma abbay taana muukkeedda; abban de'iyaa maataykka ta huup'iyaan s'aas'etteedda. <verse eid="JON 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 2:6" />Taani deri baasetteedda sa'aa duge wod'd'aad; biittaaninne Aa kubuwan med'inaw gorddettad. Shin abeet Med'inaa Godaw, ta S'oossaw, neeni ta shemppuwaa c'iimma ollaappe kessaadda.<verse eid="JON 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 2:7" />«Taani wode, neena Med'inaa Godaa hassayaadi. Ta woosaykka neekko, ne geeshsha Golliyaa Mak'idasiyaa gakkeedda. <verse eid="JON 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 2:8" />Hada eek'atoo goynniyaawaanttu GODAN ammanettiyaawaa aggeeddino. <verse eid="JON 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 2:9" />Shin taani galataana new yarshshana; taani shiik'k'eeddawaa ubbaakka gatsana. Ayaw gooppe, atotetsay Med'inaa Godaappe yee» yaageedda.<verse eid="JON 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 2:10" />Hewaappe guyye, Med'inaa Goday moliyaa azazina, molii Yoonaasa biittaa bollan c'oosheedda.<verse eid="JON 2:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JON 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JON 3" />
  <para style="s">Yoonaase Nanawe Buussaanne Asaa Nagaraa Paas'etsaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="JON 3:1-10">3:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 3:1" />Med'inaa Godaa k'aalay laa'entsuwaa Yoonaasakko hawaadan yaagiidde yeedda; <verse eid="JON 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 3:2" />«Dendda! He wolk'k'aama katamaa Nanawe ba; taani new odiyaa k'aalaa unttunttoo markkatta» yaageedda.<verse eid="JON 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 3:3" />Yoonaasi denddiide, Med'inaa Godaa k'aalaadan Nanawe beedda. Nanawe loytsi wolk'k'aama katamaa; ha gas'aappe ya gas'aa gakkanaw heezzu gallassaa hametisee. <verse eid="JON 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 3:4" />Yoonaasi katamaa bi gakkiide, itti gallassaa ogiyaa katamaa giduwaakko hametteedda; hamettiidde, «Oytamu gallassaappe guyye, Nanawe d'ayana» yaagiide awaayeedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4-5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:41">Mat. 12:41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:32">Luk'. 11:32</ref></char></note><verse eid="JON 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 3:5" />Yaatina, Nanawe Asay S'oossaa ammaneedda; s'oomaa awaayeedda. Wogaappe k'eera gakkanaw, ubbaykka maak'iyaa mayyeeddino.<verse eid="JON 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 3:6" />Oduu Nanawe kaatiyaakko gakkeedda; I bare kawutetsaa araataappe wod'd'iide, kawutetsaa mayuwaa mayyeeddawaakka k'aariide, maak'iyaa mayyiide, bidintsaan utteedda. <verse eid="JON 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 3:7" />Yaatide Nanawe asaw hawaadan yaagiide awaayiseedda; «Kaatiyaappene kaatiyaa oosanchchatuwaappe imetteedda azazuwaa maaran, hachcheppe doommiide, asaynne mehii, miizzaynne dorssaykka ubbay ayaanne ins's'arssaani laac'c'oppino; haatsaakka gans's'oppino. <verse eid="JON 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 3:8" />Asaykka mehiikka maak'iyaa mayyo; Asay ubbay minisiidde S'oossaakko waasso; barenttu iita ogiyaappenne naak'o oosuwaappekka simmino. <verse eid="JON 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 3:9" />Yaatintto ooni erii, S'oossay nuw k'arettiide, nuuni d'ayennaadan, bare wolk'k'aama hank'k'uwaappe simmanenttonne» yaageedda.<verse eid="JON 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 3:10" />Unttunttu barenttu iita ogiyaappe simmeeddawaa S'oossay be'eedda wode, unttunttoo k'arettiide, unttunttu bolla ahana geedda iitabaa aggi basheedda.<verse eid="JON 3:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JON 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JON 4" />
  <para style="s">S'oossay Immeedda Maarotaan Yoonaasa Hank'k'uwaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="JON 4:1-11">4:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 4:1" />Shin hewe Yoonaasa ubbakka nashechibeenna. Hewaa gishaw, I loytsi hank'k'etteedda; <verse eid="JON 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 4:2" />Med'inaa Godaa hawaadan yaagiide woosseedda; «Abeet Med'inaa Godaw, taani biro ta gaden de'aadde geeddawe hawaa gidennee? Taani ne sintsappe bak'ataade Tarsseese baanaw elleelleeddawe hawaassa. Neeni k'aretaynne maarotetsay kumeedda S'oossaa gidiyaawaa, hank'k'oo elleellenawaanne aggena siik'uwaan kumeeddawaa, k'ay ahana geedda iitabaakka aggiyaa S'oossaa gidiyaawaa taani kasekka eraad.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:6">Kes. 34:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JON 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 4:3" />Abeet Med'inaa Godaw, ha"i simmi hay hayyanaa taana wod'a; pas'a de'iyaawaappe hayk'k'iyaawe taw lo"a» yaageedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 19:4">1 Kat. 19:4</ref></char></note><verse eid="JON 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 4:4" />Med'inaa Goday Aa hawaadan yaageedda; «Tumu neeni hawoo hank'k'ettanaw bessii?» yaageedda.<verse eid="JON 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 4:5" />Yoonaasi katamaappe kesiide beedda; biide katamaappe away doliyaa baggan utteedda. Hewan barew daasiyaa daaseedda, Aa kuwan uttiide, katamaa bolla gakkiyaawaa be'anaw naageedda. <verse eid="JON 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 4:6" />Awaa suuluwaappe Yoonaasa ashshana mala, Med'inaa Goday S'oossay itti gosiyaa dolisiide giigisseedda; he gosiyaa haytsaykka Yoonaasa huup'iyaappe bolla baggana kuwaa gidanaadan ootseedda. Yoonaasi he gosiyaa gaasuwaan loytsi nashetteedda. <verse eid="JON 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 4:7" />Shin wonttetsa gallassi wontta S'oossay gus'uniyaa giigisseedda; he gus'unii gosiyaa moowaan, gosii meli aggeeda. <verse eid="JON 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 4:8" />Away kesso wode, S'oossay michchiyaa c'arkkuwaa away doliyaa baggappe yeddeedda; hewaappe denddeddawaan Yoonaasi labbanana gakkanaw, away Yoonaasa huup'iyaa s'uuggeedda. Yaatina I, «Pas'a de'iyaawaappe hayk'k'iyaawe taw lo"a» yaagiide hayk'k'anaw woosseedda.<verse eid="JON 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 4:9" />S'oossay Yoonaasa hawaadan yaageedda; «Tumu neeni ha gosiyaa gishaw hank'k'ettanaw bessii?» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JON 4:9">Yoonaasi, «Ee besse; ubbaa hayk'k'ana gakkanaw hank'k'ettanaw besse» yaageedda.<verse eid="JON 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 4:10" />Med'inaa Goday Yoonaasa hawaadan yaageedda; «Itti k'amman dolaade, laa"entso k'amma meleedda gosiyaw, neeni an daaburabeenabawunne dichchabeenabaw hawaa keeshshaa k'arettaadda. <verse eid="JON 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JON 4:11" />Ushechchaanne haddirssaa shaakki eribeenna s'eetanne laatamu sha"a asaynne daro mehii Nanawen de'ee. Yaatina taani ha wolk'k'aama katamaw k'arettanaw bessennee?» yaageedda.<verse eid="JON 4:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JON 4" />
</usx>